{"4181040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Immortal Rebirth", "steam_appid": 4181040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/ec2ff7f4b78030a224cb9eefc1764166.avif?t=1786331643\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/834cc96ea0d7221e341b2efc4bf071ee.poster.avif?t=1786331643\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/834cc96ea0d7221e341b2efc4bf071ee.webm?t=1786331643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/834cc96ea0d7221e341b2efc4bf071ee.mp4?t=1786331643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive relentless waves of monsters in a world inspired by Eastern fantasy.<br>Swords are only the beginning—musical instruments, calligraphy tools, and painted relics all serve as powerful weapons, each with its own combat style and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you cut through enemies with blade and steel,<br>or control the battlefield with sound, symbols, and seals?<br>Your build defines how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/361831f6078b43677c125ca9235539d5.avif?t=1786331643\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/0c18d05160f6fdf4cc93b6d5ade46164.poster.avif?t=1786331643\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/0c18d05160f6fdf4cc93b6d5ade46164.webm?t=1786331643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/0c18d05160f6fdf4cc93b6d5ade46164.mp4?t=1786331643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive pool of gear and randomized affixes awaits your digging. But landing a powerful drop is just the beginning—reforge affixes through <strong>reroll</strong>, break through limits with <strong>upgrades</strong>, and craft an ordinary piece into your ultimate endgame gear with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/945b9bbe07cf60719ce8a67733c706d8.avif?t=1786331643\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/1164e3e5eb796c9d3f003503ceeafd29.poster.avif?t=1786331643\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/1164e3e5eb796c9d3f003503ceeafd29.webm?t=1786331643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/1164e3e5eb796c9d3f003503ceeafd29.mp4?t=1786331643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ditch the traditional fixed equipment slots. All your gear sits in a grid-based backpack, where <strong>position itself is strategy</strong>—adjacent items trigger synergies, and how you arrange them defines your core build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Style — A blend of 2D pixel art and 3D ink-wash visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot-Driven Progression — Explore mystic realms, defeat enemies, and collect tons of gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory Crafting — Your backpack is your equipment grid, and item placement affects their synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear Crafting — Reforge, enhance, and imprint your gear to create your own signature gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite Elements — Random rewards and route choices make every run feel different</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/ec2ff7f4b78030a224cb9eefc1764166.avif?t=1786331643\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/834cc96ea0d7221e341b2efc4bf071ee.poster.avif?t=1786331643\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/834cc96ea0d7221e341b2efc4bf071ee.webm?t=1786331643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/834cc96ea0d7221e341b2efc4bf071ee.mp4?t=1786331643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive relentless waves of monsters in a world inspired by Eastern fantasy.<br>Swords are only the beginning—musical instruments, calligraphy tools, and painted relics all serve as powerful weapons, each with its own combat style and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you cut through enemies with blade and steel,<br>or control the battlefield with sound, symbols, and seals?<br>Your build defines how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/361831f6078b43677c125ca9235539d5.avif?t=1786331643\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/0c18d05160f6fdf4cc93b6d5ade46164.poster.avif?t=1786331643\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/0c18d05160f6fdf4cc93b6d5ade46164.webm?t=1786331643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/0c18d05160f6fdf4cc93b6d5ade46164.mp4?t=1786331643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive pool of gear and randomized affixes awaits your digging. But landing a powerful drop is just the beginning—reforge affixes through <strong>reroll</strong>, break through limits with <strong>upgrades</strong>, and craft an ordinary piece into your ultimate endgame gear with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/945b9bbe07cf60719ce8a67733c706d8.avif?t=1786331643\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/1164e3e5eb796c9d3f003503ceeafd29.poster.avif?t=1786331643\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/1164e3e5eb796c9d3f003503ceeafd29.webm?t=1786331643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/extras/1164e3e5eb796c9d3f003503ceeafd29.mp4?t=1786331643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ditch the traditional fixed equipment slots. All your gear sits in a grid-based backpack, where <strong>position itself is strategy</strong>—adjacent items trigger synergies, and how you arrange them defines your core build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Style — A blend of 2D pixel art and 3D ink-wash visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot-Driven Progression — Explore mystic realms, defeat enemies, and collect tons of gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory Crafting — Your backpack is your equipment grid, and item placement affects their synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear Crafting — Reforge, enhance, and imprint your gear to create your own signature gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite Elements — Random rewards and route choices make every run feel different</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Say goodbye to traditional equipment slots — your backpack is the battlefield! Freely arrange your items to trigger synergies, then craft and enhance your gear to create your own unique build. An action game that blends loot hunting, backpack-building, and light roguelite elements.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181040/2a38ee79a0a18a901887d5d0da765c87adfb757a/heade